//#region - After Supply Chain 

::AfterSupplyChainCh1
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene
@once

{@PAL}      The haulers arrived. Quinn is quite efficient!...For a human. 
{@PAL} 		Ready to work with our incredible new automation unit? 
{@Player}   Um... I think so. I used to work with Arken at the Fab.
{@PAL}     	OOOh, this will be soooo much faster than your human teammate. 

//EDIT - KACY 
// Added minor dialogue changes and changed Arken's name spelling (was Arkan)



//#region - Fabrication 
::AfterFabricationCh1
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply), IsSolutionFoundFor(Fabrication)
@cutscene
@once

{@PAL}      You finished the orientation! 
{@PAL}      Positive.Affirmation.exe! 
{@Player}   Back atcha bro. 
{@PAL}      My name's not bro, it's P.A.L!
{@Player} 	Right...

//endregion 

//EDIT - KACY 
// Edited Pal's line to be reminiscent to lines when PAL becomes MAL later. 